            "review_title": "Review at Com Ke Cho Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Zvikagol\nTel Aviv, Israel766 contributions\n0\nOne of the best Vietnamese restaurants in Hanoi don't miss\nOct 2017 • Couples\nFriends sent us for the quality and teste but we actually recommend the place for two other qualities: the lake view and the experience .\n\nAsk for the hot pot and for typical salads and you'll enjoy the Shaw and the food plus the view of course.\n\nWe didn't like the quality of the cocktails but after all, you don't go to this type of restaurants for the drink\nRead more\nWritten October 21, 2017",
